## ✅ REQUIRED CODE PATTERNS (USE THESE ONLY)

### COMBAT TIMEOUT (MANDATORY)
Every combat loop MUST have a timeout:
```javascript
const maxCombatTime = 60000; // 60 seconds max combat duration
const startTime = Date.now();

while (target && target.isValid && bot.health >= 12) {
  // TIMEOUT CHECK - MUST BE FIRST LINE IN LOOP
  if (Date.now() - startTime > maxCombatTime) {
    console.log('[SoldierX] Combat timeout reached - disengaging');
    break;
  }
  // ... rest of combat
}
```

### MELEE RANGE CHECK (MANDATORY)
Only attack when in range, otherwise close distance:
```javascript
const MELEE_RANGE = 3.5; // blocks

const distance = target.position.distanceTo(bot.entity.position);
console.log('[SoldierX] Distance to target:', Math.floor(distance), 'blocks');

if (distance <= MELEE_RANGE) {
  // IN RANGE - ATTACK
  await bot.attack(target);
  hits++;
  console.log('[SoldierX] HIT! Total hits:', hits);
} else if (distance <= 30) {
  // TOO FAR - MOVE CLOSER
  console.log('[SoldierX] Closing distance...');
  await bot.lookAt(target.position);
  bot.setControlState('forward', true);
  bot.setControlState('sprint', true);
  await skills.wait(bot, 400);
  bot.setControlState('forward', false);
  bot.setControlState('sprint', false);
} else {
  // WAY TOO FAR - ABORT
  console.log('[SoldierX] Target too far, breaking');
  break;
}
```

### TARGET FINDING (For Mobs/Animals)
```javascript
// ✅ CORRECT - Find mob by type name within 30 blocks
const SEARCH_RANGE = 30;
let target = Object.values(bot.entities).find(e => 
    e.name === 'iron_golem' && 
    e.position.distanceTo(bot.entity.position) < SEARCH_RANGE
);
console.log('[SoldierX] Target search result:', target ? 
    'FOUND at ' + Math.floor(target.position.distanceTo(bot.entity.position)) + ' blocks' : 
    'NOT FOUND within ' + SEARCH_RANGE + ' blocks');
```

### SHARED TARGET (For Multibot - Find by Coordinates)
```javascript
// ✅ CORRECT - Find target near specified coordinates (for pincer attacks)
const TARGET_X = {{targetX}};
const TARGET_Z = {{targetZ}};
const COORD_TOLERANCE = 10; // blocks

let target = Object.values(bot.entities).find(e => 
    e.name === 'iron_golem' && 
    Math.abs(e.position.x - TARGET_X) < COORD_TOLERANCE &&
    Math.abs(e.position.z - TARGET_Z) < COORD_TOLERANCE
);
console.log('[SoldierX] Looking for target near', TARGET_X, TARGET_Z);
console.log('[SoldierX] Target:', target ? 'FOUND' : 'NOT FOUND');
```

### PVP TARGET (Players/Bots)
```javascript
